{"posts":[{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_151","t":"Compression shown in Smaller time frame","a":"Nosbigs","d":"","n":"#151","p":7,"im":["c34817df2f40f43a08480c9fe374ec34a2a11a69"],"m":151},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_152","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#152","p":7,"im":["302c2121bce394ef680627b99ebcd13ddcbd0e3c"],"m":152},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_153","t":"Hi Gilben, and welcome\n\nI like your read so far\n\nHere's the slightly bigger picture\n\nand the m30 explanation of the weakness of the H1 D\n\nBest\n\nIf","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#153","p":7,"im":["d45d88bd7c49d12f56bc120d4738520b5d24f489","b8ce177df71b75f3f14ffd3ba396314f8febf904"],"m":153},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_154","t":"Thank you IF.","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#154","p":7,"im":[],"m":154},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_155","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#155","p":7,"im":["42db84eaeaf381d2a845a08f2642deb0498977a5"],"m":155},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_156","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#156","p":7,"im":["cfe7518cf27dd196efb6173555cd8e8e83ba5cfb"],"m":156},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_157","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#157","p":7,"im":["c44fac78c2e4455f845897cb39fe802f34f96fa6"],"m":157},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_158","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#158","p":7,"im":["52d27f14b903112049e8827f351ba0debb177126"],"m":158},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_159","t":"Hi Gilben,\n\nvery nice work are you doing. You are locating good CP.\n\nI attach a chart to show you my view on the last one you post. Yet doing myself the homework too.\n\nMainly I wanna show you how I see the Demand zones, and the interesting way in which price react to the SR levels created on this demand zones.","a":"okami","d":"","n":"#159","p":7,"im":["a440002d137fd3e4aa1e4f28a323078485fec6b5"],"m":159},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_160","t":"Thank you Okami\n\nI am just thinking I am beginning to understand the concept and consequences of Compression. Looking in your chart D3 was expected to be cleared because of the huge CP was consuming all buying orders. That is why price sliced it through straight to the following D2.","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#160","p":7,"im":["0506019ff6e1e5229374dc4217464b4d135cc1df"],"m":160},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_161","t":"Here is a CP on GU H4/D1 I just traded (in Demo) I Posted it on SETUP ROOM >> GBPUSD www.acegazette.com/en/forum/forex-majors...d.html?start=25#2740\n\ngilben wrote:\n\n...See how this'll be developing","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#161","p":7,"im":["071ad3a25556ac515ee79a3c72022619242e824a"],"m":161},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_162","t":"Hello guys,\n\nso after reading couple of articles in the forum, i decide to give a try. here is my chart on compression, i put some horizontal lines but i dunno how to explain or even if it's correct.\n\nPlease correct me if i'm wrong with the compression and chart.\n\nCheers. Lockhart","a":"rokuhaato","d":"","n":"#162","p":7,"im":["4afb6997d6e0df7e5935e4ce71f22ab66379ac4c"],"m":162},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_163","t":"Great work Lockhart\n\nMost of them are perfect Just be sure to look along the tops for price cping down, and across the lows for price cping up.\n\nBest\n\nIf","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#163","p":7,"im":["6d4b4e7a32bd9b8e9ab5b7c586349ea97cfe9299"],"m":163},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_164","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#164","p":7,"im":["6dec93f5d14d5ad7e6351be8276671967e57edc9"],"m":164},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_165","t":"Thanks If. Glad to hear that i was doing well. on your introduction to compression post, you mention about Liquidity/CPLQ, can you or anyone else please explain what is that?\n\nCheers. Lockhart","a":"rokuhaato","d":"","n":"#165","p":7,"im":[],"m":165},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_166","t":"rokuhaato wrote: Thanks If. Glad to hear that i was doing well. on your introduction to compression post, you mention about Liquidity/CPLQ, can you or anyone else please explain what is that?\n\nCheers. Lockhart\n\nHi Lockhart\n\nCPLQ is where price compressed towards S or D then in one point we have a liquidity imbalance toward the S or D. It is a place where decision is made among buyers and sellers. You can also explain it as a place where no supply or demand left and price can freely go its way.\n\nI marked in your chart, you see price compresses, consuming Demand down to where no Demand orders left","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#166","p":7,"im":["19cae4643b3c0e47ce9e0883699e2814760f7af5"],"m":166},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_167","t":"Thanks Gilben. i think i got the idea.\n\nCheers. Lockhart","a":"rokuhaato","d":"","n":"#167","p":7,"im":[],"m":167},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_168","t":"viat\n\nHello! I just want to share my first homework. All comments are welcome. Thanks","a":"—","d":"","n":"#168","p":7,"im":["11dea127fb0285e52311f7fa7ba63a6d26002a5b"],"m":168},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_169","t":"That's really nice work Viat\n\nOne thing though - your last 2 CPs need adjusting. Can you see it?","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#169","p":7,"im":[],"m":169},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_170","t":"Yes it is! I'll try to accomplish them.","a":"viat","d":"","n":"#170","p":7,"im":["1a6015294acb63d6944814f5f6990a7fec452731"],"m":170},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_171","t":"This is my first homework post cp/sd here's hoping","a":"castlerock","d":"","n":"#171","p":7,"im":["1c0c7c390782f783d68a1dd3003c62b58bea83dc"],"m":171},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_172","t":"Think i might of posted my chart in wrong place","a":"castlerock","d":"","n":"#172","p":7,"im":[],"m":172},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_173","t":"First post on homework sd/cp hope it is clear","a":"castlerock","d":"","n":"#173","p":7,"im":["1c0c7c390782f783d68a1dd3003c62b58bea83dc"],"m":173},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_174","t":"Hi all this is my first post. Thank you so much to the founders of this place and everyone here that is making this place work! I am so thankful. Feel free to comment and critique.:) Pink is the weekly S/D- 1st chart Blue is the daily S/D- 2nd Chart The 3rd chart is where the CP analysis was done.","a":"bcho018","d":"","n":"#174","p":7,"im":["8bbc3cd1714196a2e9a48ffcf1a54340abc44b30","d450842a75b19843881ba020b48e08ace64b63fd","0878901cb8911e4e473ee63cbdfbb30cd9b41497"],"m":174},{"id":"aboutcompression_p7_175","t":"Hi Binyamin,\n\nCongratulations with this thread. Nice to see people putting the time to make the homeworks. I have marked some thoughts on one of your charts... Maybe you could find it usefull.\n\nAbout the cp, I can't really see what you reffer to cp on your charts because you pointed different areas with an arrow, so could you maark a new chart with only cp on it? Maybe you could mark it with a circle or with a trendline, if you don't mind.\n\nBest, Mel","a":"@mel","d":"","n":"#175","p":7,"im":["348b9bf1e0ff6a224a15343412130de0c4c7073e"],"m":175}],"images":[{"k":"c34817df2f40f43a08480c9fe374ec34a2a11a69","t":"assets/thumbs/c34817df2f40f43a08480c9fe374ec34a2a11a69.webp","f":"assets/images/c34817df2f40f43a08480c9fe374ec34a2a11a69.png","w":1274,"h":414,"b":27545,"o":"c34817df2f40f43a08480c9fe374ec34a2a11a69.png","p":7,"pid":"aboutcompression_p7_151"},{"k":"302c2121bce394ef680627b99ebcd13ddcbd0e3c","t":"assets/thumbs/302c2121bce394ef680627b99ebcd13ddcbd0e3c.webp","f":"assets/images/302c2121bce394ef680627b99ebcd13ddcbd0e3c.png","w":1444,"h":885,"b":38034,"o":"302c2121bce394ef680627b99ebcd13ddcbd0e3c.png","p":7,"pid":"aboutcompression_p7_152"},{"k":"d45d88bd7c49d12f56bc120d4738520b5d24f489","t":"assets/thumbs/d45d88bd7c49d12f56bc120d4738520b5d24f489.webp","f":"assets/images/d45d88bd7c49d12f56bc120d4738520b5d24f489.jpeg","w":1500,"h":710,"b":79892,"o":"d45d88bd7c49d12f56bc120d4738520b5d24f489.jpeg","p":7,"pid":"aboutcompression_p7_153"},{"k":"b8ce177df71b75f3f14ffd3ba396314f8febf904","t":"assets/thumbs/b8ce177df71b75f3f14ffd3ba396314f8febf904.webp","f":"assets/images/b8ce177df71b75f3f14ffd3ba396314f8febf904.jpeg","w":1500,"h":710,"b":72376,"o":"b8ce177df71b75f3f14ffd3ba396314f8febf904.jpeg","p":7,"pid":"aboutcompression_p7_153"},{"k":"42db84eaeaf381d2a845a08f2642d